SUMMARY:Make Wood Conditioner (Paste Wax / Board Butter)
DESCRIPTION:In this class\, Bill will demonstrate his recipe and technique for making paste wax/conditioner for woodworking\, and students will then make their own.\n\nThis conditioner is used on cutting boards\, wood knife handles\, wooden kid’s toys\, and all items which need a food safe finish. Many people use paste wax on drawer slides and other woodworking items.  This will work instead of purchasing paste wax at a big box store.\n\nAll materials will be supplied by Knoxmakers and all attendees will go home with a quantity of their very own paste wax.\n\n<br>\n<br>\nThe cost is $19.96 for Knox Makers members\, $29.96 for General Public. There will be a maximum of 8 spots of this class\, and a minimum of 3 tickets must be sold. If the class minimum is not met 48 hours prior to class start time\, the class we be canceled and all tickets will be refunded.\n\n<strong>Directions- Knox Makers parking and entrance is located around the back of the SPARK building in the fenced in area.</strong>\n\nKnox Makers is a place for the Knoxville area’s engineers\, artists\, hobbyists\, innovators\, educators and entrepreneurs to work and play. We are a technology and art collective dedicated to the promotion of creativity enabled and informed by science. Our lectures\, workshops\, and outreach programs inspire and educate both members and the general public. Our workshop provides members with both the space for large projects and the tools to complete them. We are a non-profit educational organization supported by member dues and staffed by volunteers.
LOCATION:Woodworking Zone\, Knox Makers - 116 Childress St SW\, Knoxville\, TN
URL:https://events.knoxmakers.org/event/make-wood-conditioner-paste-wax-board-butter-4
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-8115-session-0@haxdb
